<p>10/30/26</p>
<iframe allow="fullscreen" loading="lazy" src="https://hyper8.monome.org/fliiin-ws/embed/" style="aspect-ratio: 1.7777778; border: none; width: 100%;"> </iframe>
<p>flin is a cyclic music box where notes sound on set intervals and various patterns unfold. @evnoj created a <a href="https://codeberg.org/evnoj/fliiin/src/branch/dev">version for iii</a> which runs on the grid itself, shown here sending midi notes to the workshop system. flin is <a href="https://hyper8.monome.org/monome-40h-app-demo-2">decades old</a>, the original made with max/msp is still around.</p>
<p>in future news, norns is ending and also returning: various situations and considerations led to a 100% hardware redesign. we're still in proving territory so details will be slowly forthcoming. estimated timeframe is early next year.</p>
